<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- TASE&nbsp;&nbsp; 28&nbsp;TEU<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- TPSE&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 50 TEU<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- IAS&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1382 TEU<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;plus others, e.g. TPSW, IMS<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;">- deadline is 26 Nov 2013<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;">Please check the enclosed&nbsp; tender file to see actual volumes and trade lanes / routes.&nbsp; We need to have your comments, in how far you would like to support the tender or not.&nbsp; Obviously,
 key volumes are within IAS as well as AESE trade, i.e. should we not find the tender interesting in these trades, it makes probably no sense to further process the inquiry.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;">Please let us have your comments by Friday, 22 Nov.&nbsp; In case positive, we need to prepare our reply within Monday the following week.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;">Thanks and regards,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;">HAMUSW / Gordon Valentiner<o:p></o:p></span></p>
